            "name": "cement_to_water_ratio",
            "expression": "col(\"cement\") / maximum(col(\"water\"), 1)",
            "reason": "The inverse of the water-to-cement ratio is a common proxy for strength. Providing both the ratio and its inverse (or a related ratio) can help the model partition the feature space more effectively."
          }
        ],
